      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In 1991, Ni hon Falcom released Brandish for the NEC PC-98 series of Japanese home computers. The game's solid popularity among its niche audience led to multiple re-releases, ports, and sequels in Japan. Outside of Japan, the Brandish series remains largely unknown.",
