    {
      "id": "p0187-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In simple terms, Brandish is a top-down \"dungeon crawler\" that combines the gameplay mechanics of action, puzzle, and role-playing games. Players are tasked with navigating 45 increasingly complex dungeons filled with monsters, traps, and secrets.",
        "raw": "In simple terms, Brandish is a top-down \"dungeon crawler\" that\ncombines the gameplay mechanics of action, puzzle, and role-playing\ngames. Players are tasked with navigating 45 increasingly complex\ndungeons filled with monsters, traps, and secrets.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
